# Comprehensive Phase-by-Phase End-to-End Testing Plan

This document establishes a rigorous, phase-by-phase testing strategy for the **Senpai Den Manga Platform**. It validates every architectural layer, database schema constraint, job queue state machine transition, provider failover rule, image processing pipeline, edge API gateway route, and frontend UI component specified in `PRD.md`, `architecture.md`, and `docs/project-roadmap.md`.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Environment Prerequisites for Full Phase Verification:**
> 1. **Local Containers:** Docker services (`mock-providers` on port 4000, `minio` on port 9000) must be running.
> 2. **Supabase & MinIO Credentials:** `.env` must contain valid `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY`, and local MinIO R2 credentials (`NEXT_PUBLIC_R2_URL=http://localhost:9000/manga-images`).
> 3. **Worker & Edge API:** `hf-worker` (port 7860/local background worker) and `cloudflare-worker` (port 8787) must be active during API & pipeline verification.

> [!NOTE]
> Testing will be conducted non-destructively using dedicated automated test scripts in `scripts/test/` and targeted HTTP requests to verify state transitions before running clean full-pipeline executions.

---

## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> None at present. All requirements and state machine specifications match the locked architectural constraints in `PRD.md` and `architecture.md`.

